```

Example of field from algolia dashboard `hasSpecialOffer: false`

The only other mention of `hasSpecialOffer` is in the current refinements widget

``` javascript
this.instantsearch.addWidget(
    instantsearch.widgets.currentRefinedValues({
        container: '#journeys-current-refined-widget',
        clearAll: 'after',
